            "value": "移除剪贴板中的当前文本内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choosing a library script copies it into this gesture. Later library edits will not change the gesture.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从脚本库选择时会将脚本复制到当前手势；之后编辑脚本库不会改变该手势。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Run Automation Scripts?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行自动化脚本？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shell scripts run directly with /bin/zsh; Terminal does not open. AppleScript runs with /usr/bin/osascript and macOS may ask for Automation access to each app it controls. Scripts can modify files and system settings, so only continue with scripts you trust.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shell 脚本由 /bin/zsh 直接运行，不会打开“终端”。AppleScript 由 /usr/bin/osascript 运行，macOS 可能会针对它控制的每个应用请求“自动化”权限。脚本能够修改文件和系统设置，请仅运行您信任的脚本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shell scripts run directly without opening Terminal. AppleScript may request Automation access the first time it controls another app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shell 脚本会直接运行，不会打开“终端”。AppleScript 首次控制其他应用时可能会请求“自动化”权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
